DATA NOTICE: hydragnn-sc26 (mace)

Data files tracked by DVC in this directory (fetch with `dvc pull`):
  mace_pipeline_capture.macepipe

What:
  A MACE correctness fixture (graphs, positions, cells, PBC flags,
  model state and 56 convolution checkpoints) captured from HydraGNN;
  see README.md and capture_manifest.json.

